Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20

Type "./chat-demo-bin"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "Hey there — this is tuigo, a TUI framework for Go."
Enter
Sleep 1200ms

Type "/music"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "/info"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "/help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Enter
Sleep 500ms

Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
